<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28581" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῠναστ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hold power</i> or <i>lordship, be powerful</i> or
				<i>influential</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				9.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				12.82
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				56.12
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ-εῦον</span>, opp. 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῆμος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.89
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ πόλις τῶν λοιπέων ἐδυνάστευε
					μέγιστον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					5.97
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., <i>to be lord over</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Οἰχαλίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					4.31
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ ἄλογοι ἡδοναὶ δ. ψυχῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.19
				</span></i>
			: c. dat., <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				14.624d
			</span></i>: generally, <i>prevail, be prevalent</i>, of a wind, of
			climate, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				3.5
			</span></i>, <i>Aër.</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				12
			</span></i>; <i>to be influential, potent</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῷ σώματι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>VM</u>
					16
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Herophil.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.619
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be ruled</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς μυρίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.503
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> Math., in 
				Pass.
			, <i>to be concerned with powers</i> of numbers, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				546b
			</span></i>.</div>
